  "notes": [
    "Factual snapshot of the Catacombs Rooms List table, in source order. Rowspans and colspans have been expanded; source spellings, duplicate rows and confirmation markers are preserved.",
    "All cells are source strings, not inferred runtime values. ∅ denotes an explicitly blank wiki cell; an empty string denotes an unannotated empty cell. Neither is automatically converted into zero or false.",
    "The wiki contains two Lava Pit rows with different details. Do not collapse them by name or choose one silently.",
    "Lava Pool is not listed. The wiki contains no room core/stable hashes, so it does not establish an alias or identify core -1005518830 / stable 1296131753.",
    "[Confirm] marks uncertainty in the source. Golden Oasis and Redstone Crypt also have secret totals that differ from the sum of their explicitly listed secret subtypes; preserve these discrepancies for review.",
    "Prince counts must come from the Princes column, never from Revive Stones, Dungeon Journals or the total crypt count. Empty Princes cells are not evidence of a Prince.",
    "Reference for manual metadata audits only. This snapshot is not loaded into the game and does not assign hashes or overwrite bundled room data."
  ],
  "footnotes": {
    "1": "Crypt: the wiki reports that its Fairy Soul was removed at an unknown date, with a More Info Needed marker; the Quest Log Misc category reportedly still includes it."
  },
